    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Localized, internet-based \"public access TV\" for apartment buildings presents an opportunity to modernize community communication and entertainment. By leveraging shared digital infrastructure, app-based platforms, and resident participation, this concept offers a scalable and accessible approach to fostering connectivity and engagement within residential complexes."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}